                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great animation with a good story, but I did experience a problem. The video comes in three chapters, and for some reason, every time I tried to select the first chapter, it just exited the app on me. I was using a Quest 3, and I tried both Virtual Desktop and Steamlink. it was the same with both. I could only watch the second and third chapters. Still, I want to hold onto it and see if I can get it to work. Also, I feel like I should note that the developers originally intended to add more episodes, but obviously they must have decided it wasn't worth it, because it's been years with no new content. It's a shame, because the quality was impressive. I definitely would have wanted more, but it's a good story unto itself too.",
